{"code": "import json, sys, numpy as np, scipy.optimize as opt
arr=np.array(json.loads(sys.stdin.read()))
output=arr[:,0]
t=arr[:,1]
P=arr[:,2]

def pred(params):
    r0, lam, K=params
    return r0*np.exp(-lam*t)*P*(1-P/K)

def loss(params):
    return np.mean((pred(params)-output)**2)
res=opt.minimize(loss,[0.01,0.01,100],method='BFGS')
print('opt',res.x,'mse',res.fun)
nonzero=output!=0
mape=np.mean(np.abs((pred(res.x)-output[nonzero])/output[nonzero]))
print('mape',mape)
"}

